        "a": "Shaurya Select SBI Credit Card is a credit card designed specifically for military personnel. It allows you to emboss the card with the insignia of the Army, Navy, Air Force, or Paramilitary forces. The card offers benefits such as domestic lounge access, accelerated reward points, and several lifestyle privileges."
